This project is a bash + jq rewrite of the following upstream projects by Joooook.
The ticket field order, seat type codes, train filter rules, output formats and
the 12306 endpoints used here come from them.

- 12306-mcp   https://github.com/Joooook/12306-mcp   (MIT License, text below)
- 12306-skill https://github.com/Joooook/12306-skill (no license file; same author,
  Python port of 12306-mcp; credited here as a reference)

